  "changes": [
    "Original Group tracks live members and retiring members separately under its existing mutex. Source membership finishes after dropping the retained guest View.",
    "The last ordinary begin-exit fixes the final status; an earlier group exit fixes it once. Cleanup finish order cannot overwrite it.",
    "Late owner stop/hold publication cannot recreate a retired task. Member identity survives nonleader exec rekeying.",
    "Final status, family/host completion and process-lock release consult original group state instead of ProcessMap liveness scans.",
    "Source CPU collection does not re-run uring cancellation, parent-death, clear_tid, OFD/native retirement or native-job abandonment.",
    "Cold descriptor projections still collect original ancillary-rights and detached-mount records. Ordinary owner retirement uses that collector once."
  ],
